1
00:01:49,997 --> 00:01:51,997


2
00:01:52,310 --> 00:01:55,042
♪ Minami no umi no ♪ 
Of the southern seas...


3
00:01:55,067 --> 00:01:55,739
♪  Yaho ♪ 
Yahoo

4
00:01:55,763 --> 00:01:58,541
♪ Hikari no shibaru ♪ 
Bound by the light...

5
00:01:58,566 --> 00:01:59,531
♪  Yaho ♪ 
Yahoo

6
00:01:59,555 --> 00:02:06,236
♪ Kawaii ni ouji ga iku sou na ♪
They say the cute prince sets sail!

7
00:02:06,261 --> 00:02:09,158
♪ Himitsu no negai yo ♪
Oh, secret wish...

8
00:02:09,714 --> 00:02:12,818
♪ Kanaete kureru ♪
Will you grant it?

9
00:02:12,861 --> 00:02:19,335
♪ Mahou no ouji ga iku sou na ♪
They say the magical prince sets sail!

10
00:02:21,279 --> 00:02:22,334
Don't laugh.

11
00:02:22,790 --> 00:02:25,300
Even if it's uncool, I'm the one who made it.

12
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:27,140
It's cool, very much so.

13
00:02:31,820 --> 00:02:37,040
Yep, off I go! I did it!

14
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:42,420
Huh?

15
00:02:42,780 --> 00:02:43,780
What's this?

16
00:02:46,141 --> 00:02:46,880
It's a shell!

17
00:02:53,290 --> 00:02:54,640
There's something inside.

18
00:03:06,226 --> 00:03:08,640
Here comes Prince Sapphire.

19
00:03:09,090 --> 00:03:12,166
I'm heading over to Lord Nylon, who is tailing them.

20
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:14,300
No way!

21
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:15,120
Tsk!

22
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:18,040
Even though it’s Golden Week...

23
00:03:19,990 --> 00:03:24,240
Grand Duke Duralumin's orders were to secretly spy on Sapphire while he’s playing around.

24
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:27,860
It’s that little angel again.

25
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:31,173
A little person came out of the shell. A little person from a shell?

26
00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:34,460
I was trapped in the shell.

27
00:03:34,614 --> 00:03:35,980
Thank you for saving me.

28
00:03:36,915 --> 00:03:40,340
He says this child was on a distant southern island.

29
00:03:40,734 --> 00:03:44,120
He says he was trapped inside the shell and drifted all the way here.

30
00:03:44,990 --> 00:03:46,500
What’s your papa’s name?

31
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,160
Genie.

32
00:03:48,184 --> 00:03:49,320
You said Genie?

33
00:03:49,835 --> 00:03:53,400
Speaking of Genie, isn’t that the name of the genie of the lamp from the Arabian Nights?

34
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,940
Is that genie your papa?

35
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:55,640
Yeah.

36
00:03:55,995 --> 00:04:00,680
He used to be in a lamp, but now he’s free and living on an island.

37
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,740
The genie of the magic lamp?

38
00:04:04,900 --> 00:04:05,900
Now this is interesting.

39
00:04:06,124 --> 00:04:09,960
If I remember correctly, a magic lamp is for making wishes.

40
00:04:10,553 --> 00:04:11,179
Yeah.

41
00:04:11,271 --> 00:04:15,433
My papa used to do whatever the person holding the lamp told him to.

42
00:04:15,620 --> 00:04:18,140
But he's not in that line of work anymore.

43
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:24,140
But since you saved me, if I tell him, I’m sure he’ll grant your wish in return.

44
00:04:24,485 --> 00:04:26,973
Hey, take me home.

45
00:04:27,125 --> 00:04:29,400
To where my papa is on the southern island.

46
00:04:29,425 --> 00:04:31,615
Please. Hey, I’m begging you.

47
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:32,558
Ah, thats...

48
00:04:33,402 --> 00:04:36,093
Tinc, let's just dump this runt somewhere.

49
00:04:36,117 --> 00:04:36,907
Huh?

50
00:04:37,070 --> 00:04:39,820
He's just talking nonsense about his dad being a magic lamp genie.

51
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,240
It’s true!

52
00:04:41,370 --> 00:04:43,033
You'll see if you take me there.

53
00:04:43,235 --> 00:04:45,093
I want to go home.

54
00:04:45,285 --> 00:04:46,320
Count me out.

55
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:52,240
Sapphire, we have to help him.

56
00:04:52,845 --> 00:04:53,720
Not a chance.

57
00:04:53,849 --> 00:04:54,849
Sapphire!

58
00:04:55,490 --> 00:04:56,700
Sapphire!

59
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:59,040
Bully!

60
00:05:00,790 --> 00:05:02,860
A genie of the lamp who grants any wish, eh?

61
00:05:02,985 --> 00:05:07,980
Alright, if I can just get my hands on that runt...

62
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:10,220
Well, if it isn't Lord Nylon!

63
00:05:11,170 --> 00:05:12,780
It certainly is a nice day...

64
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,400
What?

65
00:05:14,940 --> 00:05:15,940
Why are you here?

66
00:05:16,820 --> 00:05:18,613
Actually, I've come to escort Your Highness back to the castle...

67
00:05:18,637 --> 00:05:20,846
Alright, in that case, go straight to the castle!

68
00:05:21,015 --> 00:05:22,213
Go straight there!

69
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:24,400
Wait!

70
00:05:24,401 --> 00:05:25,401
Nylon!

71
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:29,513
I tricked him good!

72
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:47,540
It's fine, it's fine. I'll take the little guy to the house on the southern island all by myself, so there!

73
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:48,133
Really?

74
00:05:48,530 --> 00:05:51,400
In exchange, make sure Papa grants my wish.

75
00:05:54,955 --> 00:05:55,955
Wait!

76
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,226
Hand over that little person!

77
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,180
No!

78
00:05:58,360 --> 00:05:59,360
I already said no!

79
00:06:10,033 --> 00:06:11,513
Why did you come back?

80
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:12,680
What are you doing?

81
00:06:12,753 --> 00:06:14,920
It's just a little kid playing by himself...

82
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:17,013
Tink!

83
00:06:17,895 --> 00:06:18,920
Tink!

84
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,040
Don't go!

85
00:06:20,260 --> 00:06:21,380
Go away!

86
00:06:21,381 --> 00:06:22,480
I told you not to go, so there!

87
00:06:22,860 --> 00:06:25,626
I'm taking the little guy to where Papa is, so there!

88
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,640
That’s ridiculous!

89
00:06:27,995 --> 00:06:30,400
I can't possibly go to a southern island!

90
00:06:30,980 --> 00:06:31,400
Tink!

91
00:06:31,780 --> 00:06:32,300
Wait!

92
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:38,360
Hey, listen to me! If you go out to sea, there are terrifying, poisonous jellyfish!

93
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:42,080
And man-eating sharks, too!

94
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,220
Tink!

95
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:48,760
Leave me alone, leave me alone!

96
00:06:49,115 --> 00:06:50,200
I'm going home!

97
00:06:50,550 --> 00:06:51,960
Kobito-kun, stay hidden!

98
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:54,440
Tink!

99
00:06:54,515 --> 00:06:55,880
Come back!

100
00:06:55,965 --> 00:06:56,600
No!

101
00:06:56,620 --> 00:06:57,720
I said no!

102
00:06:57,721 --> 00:06:58,940
Stop it!

103
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:11,380
Take that, you monster!

104
00:07:24,726 --> 00:07:24,920
Tink!

105
00:07:25,201 --> 00:07:25,480
Row!

106
00:07:25,620 --> 00:07:26,233
Hurry!

107
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:30,100
Take that!

108
00:08:02,521 --> 00:08:03,360
Yay!

109
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:03,920
I'm saved!

110
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:05,080
I'm saved!

111
00:08:05,415 --> 00:08:07,820
Thank you, Kujira-san, for eating the man-eating shark!

112
00:08:31,170 --> 00:08:32,600
Tink is in trouble!

113
00:08:32,925 --> 00:08:33,539
Yay!

114
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:35,440
Try and catch me!

115
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,539
That whale!

116
00:08:36,730 --> 00:08:37,730
It's insane!

117
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:38,400
Huh?

118
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,879
An insane whale?

119
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:51,006
Tink!

120
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:52,140
Grab onto this!

121
00:09:03,100 --> 00:09:04,200
Tink!

122
00:09:04,530 --> 00:09:05,579
Jump!

123
00:09:10,369 --> 00:09:13,020
If I'm taken any further than this, it's all over!

124
00:09:28,621 --> 00:09:30,771
It's going to crash into the island!

125
00:09:56,420 --> 00:09:57,500
Great!

126
00:09:57,825 --> 00:09:58,920
Hey!

127
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:22,760
Hey!

128
00:10:22,930 --> 00:10:24,060
It's not a dinosaur!

129
00:10:24,180 --> 00:10:25,680
It's a rock!

130
00:10:39,420 --> 00:10:39,741
Whoa!

131
00:10:39,765 --> 00:10:41,860
Save me, Sapphire!

132
00:10:41,861 --> 00:10:42,420
Tink!

133
00:10:42,460 --> 00:10:43,460
I got you!

134
00:11:11,161 --> 00:11:11,920
It's a monster!

135
00:11:12,070 --> 00:11:12,939
Oh no!

136
00:11:36,729 --> 00:11:37,940
Help!

137
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:09,795
Yay!

138
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:10,580
It's an island!

139
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:12,040
It's a southern island!

140
00:12:12,899 --> 00:12:14,126
What should I do about Sapphire?

141
00:12:14,535 --> 00:12:16,120
I have to signal them!

142
00:12:21,439 --> 00:12:23,100
I wonder if I'll find Sapphire?

143
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:23,520
Whoa!

144
00:12:23,980 --> 00:12:24,660
What is that?

145
00:12:24,684 --> 00:12:25,720
Is it a mouse?

146
00:12:26,180 --> 00:12:26,960
When did you get here?

147
00:12:26,985 --> 00:12:27,420
Whoa!

148
00:12:27,460 --> 00:12:28,640
It's a dinosaur!

149
00:12:29,269 --> 00:12:30,440
Everyone, get him!

150
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:31,020
Whoa!

151
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,380
So many of them came!

152
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:33,100
What is it?

153
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:34,240
Whoa!

154
00:12:34,340 --> 00:12:35,400
They're coming out, they're coming out!

155
00:12:35,570 --> 00:12:36,820
Run!

156
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:37,960
Oh!

157
00:12:37,961 --> 00:12:38,961
How strange!

158
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:41,000
The trees and flowers, everything is so tiny!

159
00:12:41,449 --> 00:12:43,560
Maybe it's Kubito-kun's island.

160
00:12:43,745 --> 00:12:46,720
Look, Kubito!

161
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:51,140
Wah!

162
00:12:51,509 --> 00:12:52,720
It's scary, it's scary!

163
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,420
Help me!

164
00:12:53,740 --> 00:12:54,000
Huh?

165
00:12:54,001 --> 00:12:54,500
No!

166
00:12:54,520 --> 00:12:55,300
It's not mine!

167
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,020
I don't know this place!

168
00:12:57,060 --> 00:12:58,100
Get out!

169
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,200
Bad!

170
00:12:59,929 --> 00:13:01,060
It ran away!

171
00:13:01,772 --> 00:13:02,437
Really?

172
00:13:03,195 --> 00:13:05,140
What is this thing?! It looks like a fly-sized dinosaur!

173
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:08,500
Uwaa!

174
00:13:08,560 --> 00:13:09,100
It's angry!

175
00:13:09,265 --> 00:13:10,560
I'm sorry!

176
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:11,300
Wah!

177
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:13,360
I get it, I get it, I get it!

178
00:13:13,495 --> 00:13:15,620
I'll leave this island too!

179
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:24,640
I just have to leave, right?

180
00:13:25,020 --> 00:13:25,240
Huh?

181
00:13:25,330 --> 00:13:26,120
I wonder what that is?

182
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:27,780
Turn into this and get out!

183
00:13:28,270 --> 00:13:30,640
You dirty little tornado!

184
00:13:31,100 --> 00:13:31,540
Heh!

185
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:33,040
I'm saved!

186
00:13:33,740 --> 00:13:34,520
Uwaa!

187
00:13:34,580 --> 00:13:36,080
I'm getting dizzy!

188
00:13:43,249 --> 00:13:45,100
Someone is over there!

189
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:49,720
It looks like Tink was here!

190
00:13:50,285 --> 00:13:51,285
Tink!

191
00:13:51,519 --> 00:13:52,680
Tink!

192
00:13:55,519 --> 00:13:56,860
There are Tink's footprints!

193
00:13:59,270 --> 00:14:00,640
Tink!

194
00:14:01,259 --> 00:14:03,340
Tink!

195
00:14:04,469 --> 00:14:05,780
Where are you?

196
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,200
They disappear here!

197
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:13,500
I wonder what happened?

198
00:14:24,789 --> 00:14:25,860
Ah, huh?

199
00:14:27,109 --> 00:14:31,881
Ah, um, this place is... ah!

200
00:14:33,781 --> 00:14:37,410
- Giants?!
- Don't be afraid, little elf!

201
00:14:37,435 --> 00:14:42,900
By the way, that last place was apparently the Island of Tradition, but this time it's the Island of Giants!

202
00:14:43,319 --> 00:14:44,520
Stay quiet!

203
00:14:44,895 --> 00:14:46,380
You never know what might come out!

204
00:14:47,980 --> 00:14:48,980
Whoa!

205
00:14:49,060 --> 00:14:51,500
Everything and anything is as huge as a mountain!

206
00:14:51,675 --> 00:14:52,675
It’s incredible!

207
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:55,880
What should I do!

208
00:14:56,035 --> 00:14:57,640
I’ve landed on one heck of an island!

209
00:15:01,150 --> 00:15:02,150
ribbit!

210
00:15:02,899 --> 00:15:04,720
ribbit ribbit ribbit ribbit!

211
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:05,400
Whoa!

212
00:15:05,543 --> 00:15:07,960
Don’t eat me! Leave me alone!

213
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:09,220
ribbit!

214
00:15:09,900 --> 00:15:10,900
ribbit!

215
00:15:11,460 --> 00:15:12,460
Whoa!

216
00:15:12,500 --> 00:15:14,460
Don’t eat me!

217
00:15:15,199 --> 00:15:16,340
ribbit ribbit ribbit!

218
00:15:26,349 --> 00:15:28,460
Help!

219
00:15:35,548 --> 00:15:36,201
ribbit!

220
00:15:36,845 --> 00:15:37,485
ribbit!

221
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:40,161
Go away!

222
00:15:54,741 --> 00:15:55,760
Don't shake like that!

223
00:15:55,945 --> 00:15:57,100
I said don't sha....

224
00:16:00,008 --> 00:16:01,140
A giant man!

225
00:16:09,569 --> 00:16:11,160
Ouch!

226
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,100
Ah! Giant frogs!

227
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,780
Hello!

228
00:16:17,900 --> 00:16:19,180
ribbit ribbit!

229
00:16:21,860 --> 00:16:22,860
Huh?

230
00:16:22,990 --> 00:16:24,360
The frog called out to me?

231
00:16:27,769 --> 00:16:29,020
Please.

232
00:16:29,120 --> 00:16:31,700
We... please help us.

233
00:16:32,380 --> 00:16:33,380
Huh?

234
00:16:33,815 --> 00:16:35,720
What do you mean, "help me"?

235
00:16:37,099 --> 00:16:38,980
Ribbit ribbit ribbit!

236
00:16:38,981 --> 00:16:39,420
Huh?

237
00:16:39,839 --> 00:16:41,820
One of you is being eaten every day?

238
00:16:41,920 --> 00:16:42,340
By whom?

239
00:16:42,685 --> 00:16:43,685
Wah!

240
00:16:45,430 --> 00:16:47,180
I can't even get a word out!

241
00:16:53,960 --> 00:16:56,780
Help me!

242
00:16:58,569 --> 00:17:00,880
This frog has some paralysis medicine!

243
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,200
It’s Tinku!

244
00:17:04,440 --> 00:17:05,440
Tinku!

245
00:17:05,544 --> 00:17:06,599
It’s me!

246
00:17:06,819 --> 00:17:07,720
Tinku!

247
00:17:07,721 --> 00:17:08,721
Tinku!

248
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:10,940
Sapphire!

249
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,260
Alright!

250
00:17:18,292 --> 00:17:19,292
Now!

251
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:24,980
That’s a giant monster; we can’t defeat him by normal means!

252
00:17:45,260 --> 00:17:45,800
Oh no!

253
00:17:46,240 --> 00:17:47,240
It’s a dead end!

254
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:03,600
Sapphire!

255
00:18:03,729 --> 00:18:05,380
You’ll be killed if you stay there!

256
00:18:14,689 --> 00:18:16,000
Alright!

257
00:18:16,304 --> 00:18:20,514
Those kaeru-kun... Kaeru-kun!

258
00:18:22,549 --> 00:18:26,420
You guys, where did you get that paralysis medicine?

259
00:18:27,179 --> 00:18:29,466
From the root of the paralysis plant, ribbit!

260
00:18:29,969 --> 00:18:31,000
Is there any left?

261
00:18:32,218 --> 00:18:34,606
Ribbit ribbit, ribbit!

262
00:18:35,020 --> 00:18:36,020
Alright!

263
00:18:36,094 --> 00:18:40,360
Put all of it in your mouths, and spit it at that giant all at once!

264
00:18:40,580 --> 00:18:41,180
Where to, ribbit?

265
00:18:41,459 --> 00:18:43,280
At his feet! The giant's feet!

266
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:45,100
Ribbit ribbit ribbit!

267
00:18:50,260 --> 00:18:51,260
It's no use!

268
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,240
I can't die here!

269
00:19:06,499 --> 00:19:09,160
I'll cut off at least one of your fingers!

270
00:19:17,309 --> 00:19:19,580
Everyone, stop!

271
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:24,020
Ribbit ribbit!

272
00:19:44,165 --> 00:19:44,780
Are you ready?

273
00:19:44,979 --> 00:19:49,780
Take the paralysis medicine in your mouth... 3, 2, 1, zero!

274
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:51,040
Fire!

275
00:19:54,341 --> 00:19:56,252
He's hit!

276
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,860
It's running away, but I wonder what happened?

277
00:20:07,879 --> 00:20:09,040
Tink!

278
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:10,480
Sapphire!

279
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:11,500
Tink!

280
00:20:11,660 --> 00:20:12,660
Was that too much for you?

281
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:14,420
That's a relief!

282
00:20:14,420 --> 00:20:17,980
Say thank you to the frogs, they drove the giant man away!

283
00:20:18,040 --> 00:20:19,040
Frogs?

284
00:20:19,100 --> 00:20:20,100
Frogs dealt with a giant man?

285
00:20:30,849 --> 00:20:33,053
Tink, lure the giant man over here!

286
00:20:35,049 --> 00:20:37,353
Chomp!

287
00:20:39,620 --> 00:20:42,580
Alright, he's climbed up!

288
00:20:44,180 --> 00:20:44,720
Take him down!

289
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:46,180
Got it!

290
00:20:53,399 --> 00:20:54,760
Sapphire!

291
00:20:55,039 --> 00:20:57,660
If we don't defeat the giant man this time, it's all over!

292
00:21:02,240 --> 00:21:03,240
One more left!

293
00:21:03,514 --> 00:21:04,660
It's just one more!

294
00:21:06,530 --> 00:21:07,200
Over here!

295
00:21:07,440 --> 00:21:07,820
Over here!

296
00:21:07,821 --> 00:21:08,880
No!

297
00:21:09,179 --> 00:21:12,420
I told you no, things are crazy right now, you shouldn't come out!

298
00:21:12,584 --> 00:21:14,220
This is my island!

299
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,700
That's my dad!

300
00:21:17,169 --> 00:21:18,300
Horns are growing!

301
00:21:18,814 --> 00:21:20,380
When I get angry, my horn comes out!

302
00:21:20,539 --> 00:21:21,660
Just like Papa!

303
00:21:21,800 --> 00:21:22,240
No!

304
00:21:22,699 --> 00:21:24,180
Don't kill Papa!

305
00:21:24,709 --> 00:21:25,093
You're...

306
00:21:25,931 --> 00:21:26,981
Papa!

307
00:21:27,340 --> 00:21:28,340
It's me!

308
00:21:28,460 --> 00:21:29,660
It's Bakun!

309
00:21:30,419 --> 00:21:31,773
Bakun?

310
00:21:32,180 --> 00:21:33,586
Papa!

311
00:21:35,280 --> 00:21:36,280
Bakun!

312
00:21:40,160 --> 00:21:41,300
Oh no!

313
00:21:43,944 --> 00:21:45,379
Papa!

314
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:47,720
Papa, I missed you!

315
00:21:48,300 --> 00:21:48,860
Papa!

316
00:21:48,861 --> 00:21:49,960
Bakun!

317
00:21:55,099 --> 00:21:56,940
That child and the man...

318
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:00,920
They're falling!

319
00:22:03,620 --> 00:22:04,140
Watch out!

320
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:05,560
Look out!

321
00:22:13,819 --> 00:22:15,460
I'm so glad you made it back!

322
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:16,620
Papa!

323
00:22:16,860 --> 00:22:18,380
This person is the only good one!

324
00:22:18,559 --> 00:22:20,020
He brought me home!

325
00:22:21,699 --> 00:22:25,100
Papa was so worried he couldn't even eat!

326
00:22:25,219 --> 00:22:27,680
Was this man the one responsible for that magic lamp?!

327
00:22:28,559 --> 00:22:32,820
Bakun, you must never go out to play alone again!

328
00:22:33,054 --> 00:22:34,180
I'm sorry, Papa!

329
00:22:34,300 --> 00:22:35,500
I'm not leaving anymore!

330
00:22:35,919 --> 00:22:37,780
I'm sorry for making you worry!

331
00:22:45,339 --> 00:22:48,360
As a thank you, let me grant your wish!

332
00:22:48,815 --> 00:22:49,815
It's alright now!

333
00:22:50,179 --> 00:22:52,580
Because I misunderstood too!

334
00:22:52,659 --> 00:22:54,060
We’re even!

335
00:22:54,474 --> 00:22:56,100
I want to repay your kindness!

336
00:22:56,729 --> 00:23:00,280
Well then, pray that happiness comes to Sapphire!

337
00:23:00,390 --> 00:23:01,120
It's okay!

338
00:23:01,319 --> 00:23:02,780
I will make my own happiness!

339
00:23:03,039 --> 00:23:06,280
Papa said the Your Highness is being targeted by bad people!

340
00:23:06,360 --> 00:23:08,226
Something like that won't tear us apart!

341
00:23:08,899 --> 00:23:11,980
A man named Lord Nylon even chased us to this island!

342
00:23:11,981 --> 00:23:12,981
Lord Nylon?

343
00:23:13,700 --> 00:23:19,040
Well, he was a suspicious guy, so I used magic to turn him into a stupid duck!

344
00:23:19,665 --> 00:23:20,665
A magic duck?

345
00:23:34,539 --> 00:23:36,120
Have a safe trip, guys!

346
00:23:36,569 --> 00:23:38,320
Genie!

347
00:23:38,479 --> 00:23:41,893
Make sure to change Lord Nylon back from that stupid duck later!

348
00:23:42,539 --> 00:23:46,280
This should have taught Lord Nylon a bit of a lesson...

349
00:24:19,000 --> 00:24:27,000
Come on, it's time to set sail!

350
00:24:27,024 --> 00:24:29,024

